#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Neat` class usage {#neat-class-usage}"
msgstr "Uso de la clase `Neat` {#neat-class-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before submitting a resource-intensive Qiskit Runtime workload to execute on"
" hardware, you can use the Qiskit Runtime [`Neat` (Noisy Estimator Analyzer "
"Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-tools-"
"neat#neat) class to verify that your Estimator workload is set up correctly,"
" is likely to return  accurate results, uses the most appropriate options "
"for the specified problem, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Antes de enviar una carga de trabajo intensiva de Qiskit Runtime para "
"ejecutarse en hardware, puedes usar la clase [`Neat` (Noisy Estimator "
"Analyzer Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#neat) de Qiskit Runtime para verificar que tu carga de trabajo de"
" Estimator está configurada correctamente, que es probable que devuelva "
"resultados precisos, que usa las opciones más apropiadas para el problema "
"especificado, y más.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Neat` Cliffordizes the input circuits for efficient simulation, while retaining its structure and depth. Clifford circuits suffer similar levels of noise and are a good proxy for studying the original circuit of interest.\n"
"First, import the relevant packages and [authenticate to the Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"`Neat` Cliffordiza los circuitos de entrada para una simulación eficiente, conservando su estructura y profundidad. Los circuitos de Clifford sufren niveles de ruido similares y son un buen sustituto para estudiar el circuito original de interés.\n"
"Primero, importa los paquetes relevantes y [autentícate en el servicio Qiskit Runtime](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the environment {#prepare-the-environment}"
msgstr "Preparar el entorno {#prepare-the-environment}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize a target circuit {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"
msgstr "Inicializar un circuito objetivo {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Consider a six-qubit circuit that has the following properties:\n"
msgstr ""
"Considera un circuito de seis qubits que tiene las siguientes propiedades:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alternates between random `RZ` rotations and layers of `CNOT` gates.\n"
msgstr "Alterna entre rotaciones `RZ` aleatorias y capas de puertas `CNOT`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Has a mirror structure, that is, it applies a unitary `U` followed by its "
"inverse.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiene una estructura especular, es decir, aplica una unitaria `U` seguida de"
" su inversa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Salida de la celda de código anterior](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose single-Pauli `Z` operators as observables and use them to initialize "
"the primitive unified blocs (PUBs).\n"
msgstr ""
"Elige operadores `Z` de Pauli simple como observables y úsalos para "
"inicializar los bloques unificados primitivos (PUBs).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Cliffordize the circuits {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"
msgstr "Cliffordizar los circuitos {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The previously defined PUB circuits are not Clifford, which makes them "
"difficult to simulate classically. However, you can use the `Neat` "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method to map them to Clifford circuits for more "
"efficient simulation.  The "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method is a wrapper around the "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford) transpiler pass, which "
"can also be used independently. In particular, it replaces non-Clifford "
"single-qubit gates in the original circuit with Clifford single-qubit gates,"
" but it does not mutate the two-qubit gates, number of qubits, or circuit "
"depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Los circuitos PUB definidos anteriormente no son de Clifford, lo que los "
"hace difíciles de simular clásicamente. Sin embargo, puedes usar el método "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) de `Neat` para mapearlos a circuitos de Clifford y "
"obtener una simulación más eficiente. El método "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) es un envoltorio alrededor del paso de Transpiler "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford), que también puede usarse"
" de forma independiente. En particular, reemplaza las puertas de un solo "
"qubit no Clifford del circuito original con puertas de un solo qubit de "
"Clifford, pero no modifica las puertas de dos qubits, el número de qubits ni"
" la profundidad del circuito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) for more information about Clifford circuit simulation.\n"
"First, initialize `Neat`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Consulta [Simulación eficiente de circuitos estabilizadores con las primitivas de Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) para obtener más información sobre la simulación de circuitos de Clifford.\n"
"Primero, inicializa `Neat`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, Cliffordize the PUBs.\n"
msgstr "A continuación, Cliffordiza los PUBs.\n"

